Package: gipsDA
Title: Discriminant Analysis with Permutation-Invariant Covariance Projection
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Antoni", "Kingston", , "qqtrol@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits linear and quadratic discriminant analysis models using
    covariance matrices projected onto permutation-invariant structures
    estimated by the 'gips' framework. Formula, matrix, and data-frame
    interfaces are provided together with multiple prediction rules.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/AntoniKingston/gipsDA,
    https://antonikingston.github.io/gipsDA/
BugReports: https://github.com/AntoniKingston/gipsDA/issues
